  "description": "Browser-local workflow draft persistence: the V2 draft cache and LRU index, workspace- and tab-scoped storage keys, localStorage/sessionStorage IO, the draft store, autosave, and the boot-time restore that reopens tabs and the active workflow. Workflow files, the workflow store, and workflowService remain in workflow management and core; shared-URL and template-URL loading are consumed from their own capabilities.",
